Vāyu greets Brahmā and child revives by touch --- Brahmā bids gods grant boons pleasing Vāyu --- Indra names Hanumān and grants bolt immunity --- Sun Varuṇa Yama grant splendor scriptures deathlessness health --- Śiva Kubēra Brahmā Viśvakarman grant weapon immunity long life --- Brahmā foretells Rāvaṇa destroying Rāma pleasing deeds --- Vāyu returns boon filled son to Añjanā --- Hanumān wrecks rites provoking sages curse of forgetfulness --- Hanumān befriends Sugrīva unaware through Vālin feud --- Agastya hails god made scholar and departs with sages